<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
    <content contentuid="hf9ae34c1g23a1g4db9gb0dbg53aaf95eef82" version="1">武侠</content>
    <content contentuid="he84d54b6g3bd0g4693g9cb3g148897371853" version="1">武侠修习古老的东方武学，将内力与武功精髓相结合。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;内力系统：&lt;/strong&gt;获得气力骰子作为特殊资源，可用于施展武功技能。气力骰子随等级提升而增加。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;武功流派：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;医药：&lt;LSTag
        Type="Passive" Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_HuangDiNeiJing"&gt;黄帝内经&lt;/LSTag&gt; -
        精通医术，治疗盟友。&lt;br&gt;硬功：&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_JinGangBuHuaiShenGong"&gt;金刚不坏神功&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_DaJinGangShenLi"&gt;大金刚神力&lt;/LSTag&gt; -
        强化防御与力量。&lt;br&gt;轻功：&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_TiYunZong"&gt;梯云纵&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_YiWeiDuJiang"&gt;一苇渡江&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_LingBoWeiBu"&gt;凌波微步&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_FeiXuQingYanGong"&gt;飞絮轻烟功&lt;/LSTag&gt; - 增强机动性。&lt;br&gt;内功：&lt;LSTag
        Type="Passive" Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_YiJinJing"&gt;易筋经&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_XiSuiJing"&gt;洗髓经&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_BingXinJue"&gt;冰心诀&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_TianCanGong"&gt;天蚕功&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_BuSiYinFa"&gt;不死印法&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_ShenZhaoJing"&gt;神照经&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_LingBoWeibu"&gt;凌波微步&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_MingMuGong"&gt;明目功&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_ZuoYouShouHuBoShu"&gt;左右手互搏术&lt;/LSTag&gt; - 修炼内在力量与精神技巧。&lt;br&gt;外功：&lt;LSTag
        Type="Passive" Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_WuLeiTianXinJue"&gt;五雷天心诀&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_TaiJiQuan"&gt;太极拳&lt;/LSTag&gt; -
        掌控雷电之力与太极之道。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;随着等级提升，可在各流派中深入修习，最终达到武功大成的境界。</content>
    <content contentuid="hbd34047cg9f09g43c6g8c47g590bb07f9d17" version="1">武功</content>
    <!-- 硬功 -->
    <content contentuid="he86e97a0gf404g49e6g9d48g9df39c696dbd" version="1">硬功</content>
    <content contentuid="h5588c27agf95fg466bgb44egd88a73a689ee" version="1">选择硬功进行修习。</content>
    <content contentuid="hb5884a09g33c0g4908ga7d1g1c277630bfd5" version="1">金刚不坏神功</content>
    <content contentuid="h58031c2dgb037g493fgab67g50139ff50c99" version="1">受到的穿刺、钝击、劈砍、力场伤害减少体质
        &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;调整值&lt;/LSTag&gt; [1]。&lt;br&gt;获得&lt;LSTag
        Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_KungFuMaster_JinZhongZhao"&gt;金钟罩&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag
        Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_KungFuMaster_TieBuShan"&gt;铁布衫&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="hcebcd611gaa70g4854gaeafg191511ecd8d5" version="1">金钟罩</content>
    <content contentuid="hf695d1a4g3cfcg4353gaacdg9080f7d81d38" version="1">施法者和 [1] 范围内的队友
        &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免检定&lt;/LSTag&gt; 获得一个体质 &lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;调整值&lt;/LSTag&gt; 的加值。</content>
    <content contentuid="hd2aa6de7g6596g45c4gbcdbg8307d584920f" version="1">铁布衫</content>
    <content contentuid="h59dfaff5gfd53g4de4gba58ge5fd85887972" version="1">当你即将被一个敌人命中时，&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;护甲等级&lt;/LSTag&gt; +[1]。同时完全防止 &lt;LSTag Type="Spell"
        Tooltip="Projectile_MagicMissile"&gt;魔法飞弹&lt;/LSTag&gt; 对你造成的伤害。</content>
    <content contentuid="hd3f2a30cg933cg4e95ga3deg55989e394873" version="1">免疫魔法飞弹。&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;护甲等级&lt;/LSTag&gt; +[1]。</content>
    <content contentuid="h174714ebgc630g445dga4d1g0550a18efbec" version="1">铁布衫</content>
    <content contentuid="h1876724fg1229g41e9g9f20g850e5967bf45" version="1">你不受所有效果和伤害影响，同时无法造成伤害。此外，&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移动速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;清零。</content>
    <content contentuid="hwf8wk8k9ga784gufegfubr9vmdgt4pvvynmgwkj7b3ao" version="1">不灭金身</content>
    <content contentuid="hnvulzbiqgyfinir73gfkf25rh8ggxmnm46pgl4w3dlto" version="1">铁布衫</content>
    <content contentuid="hq01iz7dkgksfusll8ghihjz2z3g95te09lrgmrokf9zs" version="1">短时间内大幅提升防御力，受到的穿刺、钝击、劈砍、力场伤害减少体质&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;调整值&lt;/LSTag&gt; [1]。持续3回合。</content>
    <content contentuid="hoczwi2fvgvd1ph84jgyhrhzj3zgw4h66kh4gdxbs6frj" version="1">铁布衫</content>
    <content contentuid="hnwkx7xo1gmuexpvfsg2dntl9wqgvpanvu2qgwtlx786v" version="1">受到的穿刺、钝击、劈砍、力场伤害减少体质&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;调整值&lt;/LSTag&gt; [1]。</content>
    <content contentuid="h5007e0ebg5a58g4da0gbe36g93017b27d17c" version="1">大金刚神力</content>
    <content contentuid="ha627cd63g0326g496fg8e26gf87b4593a1e9" version="1">修炼至极致的刚猛内力，专精于徒手战斗和内力运用。可以将你的力量&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;调整值&lt;/LSTag&gt; [1] 加到徒手攻击伤害、远程徒手攻击伤害和力场伤害上。</content>
    <!-- 软功 -->
    <content contentuid="hd73e6a09g5e3bg4e44g960egbe91f6675c1d" version="1">软功</content>
    <content contentuid="h97decd04g955cg49f4g9b3cg0a5dc50219a7" version="1">选择软功进行修习。</content>
    <content contentuid="h681edf83gb56cg4a83gac08gf735251f317d" version="1">明目功</content>
    <content contentuid="h8efb89f9g5e4cg4014g86c4g9b00343ce7e8" version="1">获得范围为[1]的&lt;LSTag
        Type="Passive" Tooltip="SuperiorDarkvision"&gt;黑暗视觉&lt;/LSTag&gt;。免疫&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="BLINDED"&gt;目盲&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="CHARMED"&gt;魅惑&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="FRIGHTENED"&gt;恐慌&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="MADNESS"&gt;疯狂&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="SURPRISED"&gt;受惊&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="hcfe443adg79efg4d38g9874g31381a17f8d8" version="1">神机百变</content>
    <content contentuid="h4b255013gd765g4f09g8f7fg10da16e0f520" version="1">获得&lt;LSTag Type="Action"
        Tooltip="DisguiseSelf"&gt;伪装术&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="hcf746165g6699g4ae3ga1f6gb11027870777" version="1">左右手互搏术</content>
    <content contentuid="h38c8f50cg329dg440eg980dgc7fb37f8443c" version="1">
        熟练地掌握双武器战斗。&lt;br&gt;徒手攻击时额外造成1d6伤害。暴击时可进行额外攻击。每回合第一次徒手攻击获得&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <!-- 轻功 -->
    <content contentuid="h6a27bd83gbff9g449bgbd0bg7ab357df5e21" version="1">轻功</content>
    <content contentuid="he94a2dbfg4862g4eb0ga2dbg066ba04130a3" version="1">选择轻功进行修习。</content>
    <content contentuid="h0735f7aag028fg4f50g91a3g2480891e7eea" version="1">梯云纵</content>
    <content contentuid="hf8bb6033g741cg4852g9b84g62e96b1fba44" version="1">如白鹤腾空，瞬息入云。&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag
        Type="Action" Tooltip="Jump"&gt;跳跃&lt;/LSTag&gt;距离增加 [1] 并翻三倍，且不消耗&lt;LSTag
        Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;附赠动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="hc0decce3g35ecg4ef6gaeb1g69746c6100ba" version="1">一苇渡江</content>
    <content contentuid="h18c06e21gd830g46dfg8b98g36dc52717f77" version="1">鲸波万里，一苇可航。&lt;br&gt;&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移动速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;增加[1]，在水性地表和冰面额外增加[2]。移动速度不会被&lt;LSTag
        Type="Status" Tooltip="DIFFICULT_TERRAIN"&gt;劣势地形&lt;/LSTag&gt;、魔法效果降低，免疫地表的&lt;LSTag
        Type="Status" Tooltip="WET"&gt;濡湿&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="CHILLED"&gt;冻僵&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="SPIKE_GROWTH"&gt;荆棘丛生&lt;/LSTag&gt;的影响。移动不会招致&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="OpportunityAttack"&gt;借机攻击&lt;/LSTag&gt;。免疫&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="RESTRAINED"&gt;束缚&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="WEB"&gt;网缚&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="ENTOMBED"&gt;茧缚&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="ENSNARED"&gt;捕获&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="PETRIFIED"&gt;石化&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="TWN_TOLLHOUSE_GOLDIFIED"&gt;成金&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="CRIPPLED"&gt;跛足&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="HAMSTRING"&gt;伤筋&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="PIN_DOWN"&gt;受制&lt;/LSTag&gt;。获得&lt;LSTag Type="Spell"
        Tooltip="Shout_KungFuMaster_Dash"&gt;踏雪无痕&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="h4cbfeb20gf142g4c3bga4e6gcf9c4acb88e6" version="1">踏雪无痕</content>
    <content contentuid="h9a8b72a0gf46dg433ag9a02gf0785a95b7bc" version="1">疾风快影，来去无迹。&lt;br&gt;本回合的活动距离变大，&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移动速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;加倍。</content>
    <content contentuid="he42f3386g62d7g4d28gbeefgc6a99e526e86" version="1">凌波微步</content>
    <content contentuid="hf635c638g7c69g4197gbe5cg6e9d011c993f" version="1">休迅飞凫，飘忽若神。&lt;br&gt;免疫&lt;LSTag
        Type="Status" Tooltip="PARALYZED"&gt;麻痹&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="PRONE"&gt;倒伏&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="KNOCKED_OUT_BASE"&gt;倒地&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="GRAPPLED"&gt;擒抱&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="INCAPACITATED_DND"&gt;失能&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="COMMAND_APPROACH"&gt;强制接近&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="COMMAND_FLEE"&gt;逃跑&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="TURNED"&gt;驱散&lt;/LSTag&gt;。不会被任何动作强制移动。不会受到&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重击&lt;/LSTag&gt;，受到攻击会施展&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="BLUR"&gt;神行百变&lt;/LSTag&gt;。获得&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Evasion"&gt;反射闪避&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="h46bea85dg9862g4327g8536g832ea4bc3c8f" version="1">神行百变</content>
    <content contentuid="hd5312865g12f1g4fb5gbec8g270019260fad" version="1">攻击者在针对此生物进行&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击掷骰&lt;/LSTag&gt;时会处于&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="Disadvantage"&gt;劣势&lt;/LSTag&gt;，除非他们不依赖视觉或可以看穿幻术。</content>
    <content contentuid="h4e912cb3g0127g4ba8gb689gf3a0bf2cb756" version="1">
        &lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击掷骰&lt;/LSTag&gt;获得&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;，为敌人的攻击掷骰强加&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="Disadvantage"&gt;劣势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;Br&gt;如果隐形个体发动攻击、做出动作或受到伤害，则隐形状态提前结束。</content>
    <content contentuid="h8e41fc32g21edg4917g9ef9g64b444f148d4" version="1">飞絮轻烟功</content>
    <content contentuid="h5c9d56feg8979g4b89gbab1g8f4398eac6c0" version="1">轻盈若飞絮，飘忽若蝙蝠，来无影去无踪。&lt;br&gt;获得鬼影迷踪、&lt;LSTag
        Type="Action" Tooltip="MistyStep"&gt;移形换影&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Action"
        Tooltip="MirrorImage"&gt;螺旋九影&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Action"
        Tooltip="FogCloud"&gt;五罗轻烟&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
    <content contentuid="h112e3c6dgd9b3g4e6dg8838g440b2af60307" version="1">鬼影迷踪</content>
    <content contentuid="hc130da9ag9b81g4108gbda6g35abdfe0a510" version="1">幽鬼行游，若即若离。当你被攻击时，可以使用
        &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Reaction"&gt;反应&lt;/LSTag&gt; 动作在你和攻击者的攻击范围之间插入自己的一个幻影复制体，让攻击无法命中。</content>
    <content contentuid="h506afe25gece8g4981gbd5cg835ca5f30e73" version="1">移形换影</content>
    <content contentuid="h312eda7fg99d7g4504gb075g2f3c0b7e0db4" version="1">传送到[1]范围内的位置。</content>
    <content contentuid="hbec4f3b2g3f64g42f5g96e6g9c1ed60289bd" version="1">螺旋九影</content>
    <content contentuid="h4b3f8049g7be9g4f19gbcfcgfdda670d6031" version="1">创造出9个自身的幻影复制体，分散攻击者的注意力。每个幻影让你的&lt;LSTag
        Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;护甲等级&lt;/LSTag&gt;+1。</content>
    <content contentuid="h455264d9ge55ag4bc5g85c6g188770b81db5" version="1">每当成功躲避一次攻击时，一个幻影就会消失。</content>
    <content contentuid="h6c7b5e76gda38g419ega1f9g5a85de6a54e2" version="1">第二幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="hffde06e8g0aabg4a48g92e7ga9549ad674c4" version="1">第三幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="h2d44f9b4g1e6ag42e4gb04dg7d0616ea9f1a" version="1">第四幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="hcfdad618gdd2eg4e5cgb6fdgc91f57b8e601" version="1">第五幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="hfa7db201gd094g460bg90fbge367c9e9abbe" version="1">第六幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="hff45644ag7894g4642g9c52gc42d9eee495b" version="1">第七幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="h13623ff3g30a1g4880gaf9fg9a2e1d5e85de" version="1">第八幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="hcfd4d5b9g598fg4f63g9403g21280f044ceb" version="1">第九幻影</content>
    <content contentuid="h17455be4ge0edg4546g9a34g8b5df8cf1f56" version="1">五罗轻烟</content>
    <content contentuid="hd141dc48g4c10g4458gb7ffge9fa8e663cd9" version="1">轻烟让内部的生物陷入&lt;LSTag
        Type="Status" Tooltip="BLINDED"&gt;目盲&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态。</content>
    <!-- 内功 -->
    <content contentuid="h6c9d2010gadaeg4d69g9a3dg9f8444fc22ad" version="1">内功</content>
    <content contentuid="hf74ad82dg5348g4b04gaedfga9f21f55f4e1" version="1">选择内功进行修习。</content>
    <content contentuid="h504750b7g4eb0g4e37g8762g3cbdcbb49db9" version="1">易筋经</content>
    <content contentuid="h51b64495g6d3ag432cga145g1f7781cfc8e0" version="1">所有检定+2。免疫&lt;LSTag
        Type="Status" Tooltip="DISEASED"&gt;疾病&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status"
        Tooltip="POISONED"&gt;中毒&lt;/LSTag&gt;。如果同时习得&lt;LSTag Type="Passive"
        Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_XiSuiJing"&gt;洗髓经&lt;/LSTag&gt;，则获得一个额外的动作。</content>
    <content contentuid="hda2ef061g597dg4037g82b3g2b71b77d7cf8" version="1">洗髓经</content>
    <content contentuid="h5ccafcfegbee3g4d12g8e9dg2eddb1f8f703" version="1">全属性+1。如果同时习得&lt;LSTag
        Type="Passive" Tooltip="Passive_KungFuMaster_YiJinJing"&gt;易筋经&lt;/LSTag&gt;，则获得两个额外的附赠动作。</content>
    <content contentuid="h4590d42cg7a63g48b2gaed2g8b457fcd8fe5" version="1">天蚕功</content>
